= Piłsudski criticises parliament

“[+ pl_crit_quote +]”

Józef Piłsudski again speaks out against the Sejm, this time over [+ pl_crit_topic +]. The words are his own; the occasion in the game is a simplification. PPS may answer with this month's action; without an answer within three months the card disappears and the journal records our silence.

- @support
- @defend
- @reform
- @easy_discard

@support
title: Support the criticism of parliamentarism
subtitle: Costs this month's action. The relation with Piłsudski improves (+4); Piłsudczycy dissent falls (−3) and Centre dissent rises (+5). The authority of the Sejm falls for twelve months (−2). [+ pl_crit_warning +]
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'support').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@defend
title: Defend parliament and the lawful change of governments
subtitle: Costs this month's action. The relation with Piłsudski worsens (−4); Piłsudczycy dissent rises (+5) and Centre dissent falls (−3). The authority of the Sejm grows for twelve months (+1).
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'defend').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'defend');
!}
go-to: result

@reform
title: Parliament should be reformed to work better
subtitle: Costs this month's action. No change of relation; Centre dissent falls (−2). It supports the line of reform but creates no project, path or votes.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'reform').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'reform');
!}
go-to: result

@result
